SpeexDSP sources vendored from https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/speexdsp
(BSD licence, COPYING beside this file).

Snapshot: libspeexdsp/ and include/speex/ as of upstream commit 3ad2acb1
("resample_sse: use 2 accumulators to break data dependency",
2026-06-01). That is release SpeexDSP-1.2.1 plus the three later upstream
commits that touch a vendored file:

  1d99e79f  resample_neon.h: add missing stdint include for aarch64
  738e1790  libspeexdsp: fix typos in comments
  e8a18dcd  smallft: mark constants as const

The next upstream commit to touch a vendored file is e565ed9e
(2026-06-08, resample_neon.h), so the snapshot was taken between
e8a18dcd and 3ad2acb1 inclusive.

Files: the seven .c files build.rs compiles (fftwrap, filterbank,
kiss_fft, kiss_fftr, mdf, preprocess, smallft), the private headers they
include, and speex/speexdsp_types.h, speex_echo.h, speex_preprocess.h; all
byte-identical to upstream at that commit. One file is generated rather
than copied: speex/speexdsp_config_types.h comes from upstream's
speexdsp_config_types.h.in with <stdint.h> and the C99 fixed-width types,
which is what configure emits on every platform Steno builds for.

Verified 2026-10-03 against a clone of the upstream repository.
